# Service row reading order

A priced service row uses the same order at every width, including the green Added row:

1. Name on its own line. Show the full text. It may wrap. Do not ellipsis, and do not shrink it to share the line with the price.
2. Price and duration on the next line, in `.serviceFacts`, start-aligned with the name text after the marker.
3. Description under that, with the same indent.
4. Add / Added in its own column, vertically centered on the text block.

The expanded phone panel uses that same price-and-duration line. `FitName` is the name element only.
